#   labwc's one entrypoint (no shebang, runs under /bin/sh). Restores
#   display state, brings up the theme/wallpaper, starts mako and
#   waybar. waybar is started inside bootstrap_or_relaunch_theme(), not
#   here — an unconditional `waybar` here would race the one
#   syn-theme-apply already starts on first login.
